  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 537.07 Third Party Liability. All third party obligations shall be exhausted before medicaid may be billed in accordance with He-W 521.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #4884, eff 8-1-90, EXPIRED: 8-1-96\n\nNew. #6725, eff 4-1-98, EXPIRED: 4-1-06",
